T*
(telecommunications \(DWDM\), Radar, and Navigation \(GPS, NavIC\).) Tj
T*
(* 2. VLSI Design & Microelectronics: Very Large Scale Integration \(VLSI\), Digital) Tj
T*
(ASIC design, Analog mixed-signal design, FPGA prototyping, System-on-Chip \(SoC\)) Tj
T*
(architectures.) Tj
T*
(* 3. Embedded Systems & Internet of Things \(IoT\): Real-time microcontrollers,) Tj
T*
(firmware engineering, sensor networks, edge intelligence, cyber-physical automation.) Tj
T*
(* 4. Digital Signal & Image Processing \(DSP\): Mathematical algorithms transforming) Tj
T*
(real-world signals: audio/speech processing, biomedical telemetry \(ECG, EEG, MRI\),) Tj
T*
(radar signal detection, computer vision.) Tj
T*
(* 5. RF, Microwave & Antenna Engineering: High-frequency electromagnetic waveguiding,) Tj
T*
(microwave integrated circuits \(MMIC\), phased-array beamforming antennas,) Tj
T*
(electromagnetic compatibility \(EMC/EMI\).) Tj
T*
