(* 2. Discrete Transistor Era \(1950s-1960s\): Replaced tubes with discrete) Tj
T*
(germanium/silicon transistors. Power consumption dropped 100x; reliability surged by) Tj
T*
(orders of magnitude.) Tj
T*
(* 3. Microprocessor Revolution \(1970s-1990s\): Intel 8086 \(29,000 transistors, 3 um) Tj
T*
(process\) enabled personal computing. Progressed to Pentium processors packing) Tj
T*
(millions of transistors.) Tj
T*
(* 4. Modern Heterogeneous SoC \(Apple M3 / Qualcomm Snapdragon 8 Gen 3, 2024\):) Tj
T*
(Fabricated on TSMC 3-nanometer GAA process. Packs over 90 BILLION transistors onto a) Tj
T*
(silicon die smaller than a postage stamp! Integrates high-performance CPU cores,) Tj
T*
(multi-core GPU, dedicated Neural Processing Unit \(NPU\), 5G baseband modem, image) Tj
T*
(signal processor \(ISP\), and unified LPDDR5X memory controller on a single substrate) Tj
T*
(consuming less than 15 Watts.) Tj
