T*
(Hardware Subsystem Walkthrough:) Tj
T*
(* 1. Antenna Array & Front-End Module \(FEM\): Multiple-Input Multiple-Output \(MIMO\)) Tj
T*
(antenna arrays supporting sub-6 GHz and millimeter-wave \(mmWave: 24-40 GHz\).) Tj
T*
(Integrated RF switches, low-noise amplifiers \(LNA\) for receiving microvolt signals,) Tj
T*
(and power amplifiers \(PA\) with envelope tracking.) Tj
T*
(* 2. RF Transceiver IC: Direct conversion \(Zero-IF\) homodyne architecture.) Tj
T*
